One-shot, reviewed request to publish DHUN v1.00.002 from the commit that adds this file to main.

This is the re-issue of the withdrawn 2026-10-15 v1.00.002, whose Windows build crashed
seconds after the main window opened with KoinApplicationAlreadyStartedException. The fix
(PR #179) initializes Koin exactly once per process, outside the Compose application scope;
the defective release and its tag were deleted by the maintainer's instruction so this
publish can recreate them from the fixed commit.

This file is deliberately new in this PR. The test-release workflow compares the main push
commit to its first parent and selects the public channel only when this exact path is
added. PR builds and later main pushes cannot reuse this request. Its publication job still
requires green APK and MSI builds, packaged Android identity 1.00.002 / 7, a hosted Windows
install-over check, a current-main SHA match, complete nonempty checksummed/provenanced
draft assets, and a public prerelease flag. The legacy-dev-release purge is never enabled
on this push path. The existing v1.00.001 release is untouched.
